Bind Npc 24410 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14410 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 202 "Barbeque Ingredient"
    Journal for karus "You must bring 2 Tyon Meats to [Imperial Palace Chef] to receive experience."
    Journal for elmorad "You must bring 2 Tyon Meats to [Imperial Palace Chef] to receive experience."
    Collect 2 of 379204000

Requires player level >= 46

Rewards
    Give 2500000 experience
    Give 1 of 389620000

direction_14 = location "Tyon" about "Tyon\nBoar monster evolved by Pathos' evil power" found "El Morad " at 1684 779 in zone 2
direction_344 = location "Tyon" about "Tyon\nBoar monster evolved by Pathos' evil power" found "Karus" at 360 1300 in zone 1

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master, it's time for the Imperial Palace Chef to start cooking. Go see what he's up to."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, it's time for the Imperial Palace Chef to start cooking. Go and see him."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Don't you think I should make a fabulous dish!?\n\nOh, no. I'm going to make BBQ but I'm short on Tyon meat."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Can you bring me 2 slabs of Tyon meat from the nearby farm? I will make you great BBQ and a handsome reward in return. How about it?\n\nThe Imperial Palace Chef  will give a reward for the Tyon meat he needs and receive the quest which entails delivering BBQ to the Lunar Gate Sentinel."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Don't you think I should make a lavish dish!?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Can you find me 2 slabs of Tyon meat from the nearby farm? I'll give you a hefty reward and some BBQ. What do you say?\n\nThe Imperial Palace Chef will give a reward for the Tyon meat he needs and receive the quest which entails delivering BBQ to the Lunar Gate Sentinel."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "Tyons live near the farm to the right of the castle. They're a bit savage so be careful."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_344
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Tyons live to the right of the nearby farm. They're a bit wild so be careful now."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_14

On ready
    If player is karus
        Say "Master, you have collected all slabs of Tyon meat. Let's go the Imperial Palace Chef."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, you've collected all slabs of Tyon meat. Let's go to the Imperial Palace Chef."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Oh! You brought them? Here's your reward."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Wow! You brought them!?!? Here's your reward."
